Package: oodirname
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: DIRECTORY STRIPPER
 Extracts parent directory portion from path strings adhering to POSIX standards.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
